nexus-typed-decision: third-party notices

The question-and-answer model (Noul, Choice and Score), the per-request
output schema, the two answer modes, the document escaping, the corrective
retry and parts of the system-prompt wording follow system-one-adapter-python
v0.2.1 (commit e1d4cc938204b22fc5a3c3aca7044072fe3f712d,
https://github.com/typesafe-ai/system-one-adapter-python), ported to Rust and
changed for Mother. No adapter code is vendored and no Python ships. The files
that port its text or algorithms (src/render.rs and src/projection.rs) carry
this notice in their headers.

